# A small detective story, used to explain LL(1), FIRST and FOLLOW by hand
# (guide 11 and the defense notes). It is LL(1): no cell of its table has two rules.
# Try it with: npm run sabueso -- first-follow --grammar-file examples/grammars/mini-detective.grammar --steps
%start Relato
Relato    -> Inicio Pistas Final
Inicio    -> CRI Hallazgo | HAL
Hallazgo  -> HAL | ε
Pistas    -> Pista MasPistas
MasPistas -> Pista MasPistas | ε
Pista     -> PIS | INT
Final     -> REV Epilogo
Epilogo   -> EPI | ε
